ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260901/202609010415463549_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260901/202609010415463549_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【梅西从国家队退役】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a95982cdff39native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">突发！梅西宣布从阿根廷国家队退役：这是一个让我心痛的决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608312319001659.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608312319001659.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608312319001659.jpg"> </div><p>39岁的梅西通过个人社媒宣布，自己从阿根廷国家队退役。梅西在长文中表示，这些文字写于7月21日。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9598a6ece25native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西：我掏空自己再无余力付出 经历父亲的事情后更确信这个决定</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9598a980e8fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西国家队生涯最后一战是世界杯决赛获亚军，决赛后两天做出决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260721/6a5f572033db0.jpg"> </div><p>梅西宣布从阿根廷国家队退役，他在国家队生涯的最后一战是上个月进行的世界杯决赛，阿根廷不敌西班牙获得亚军。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a95993e61cdenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">39岁梅西国家队成绩：207场125球68助 世界杯1冠2亚2座美洲杯冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32293213497.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32293213497.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a32293213497.jpg"> </div><p>39岁梅西宣布从阿根廷国家队退役，梅西阿根廷国家队生涯出场207次贡献了125个进球68个助攻，收获了1座大力神杯2座美洲杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a959c3c92401native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">梅西世界杯纪录：21球射手榜第二 12次助攻第一 6届世界杯1冠2亚</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a959edf1a239native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">合同还有2年！梅西昨天任意球双响4射1传 今天宣布从阿根廷队退役</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95a44b7dc69native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仪式感满满！梅西手写三页国家队告别信，笔帽上印有2022卡塔尔</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95a7514395fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">定格在125球！梅西国家队进球数排名历史第2，仅次于C罗146球</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95a6ffd4bd6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">一个时代宣告结束！梅西退出阿根廷国家队，谁是下一任领军者？</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95ae54c6b44native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恩佐长文告别梅西：和你一起踢球，我多幸运！谢谢你教会我的一切</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95bad0a383dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">劳塔罗告别梅西：谢谢你队长！！感谢你让我们成为你历史的一部分</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95cd1080446native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安妞@梅西：孩子们为父亲骄傲，有一天他们会理解你的故事多伟大</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95f3ac2f3a3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅致敬梅西：祝贺你拥有一段辉煌且令人难忘的国家队生涯</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95c30530fdenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">母亲谈梅西国家队退役决定：一家人都非常难过，但重要的是他幸福</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95c6de52728native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">迪马利亚社媒致敬梅西：荣幸生在同时代见证你实现梦想 你是GOAT</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95b0cc0d7d2native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷总统米莱社媒晒照向梅西致敬：非常感谢！非凡先生！</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95b64dca0ednative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">🐐帕雷德斯致敬梅西：面对你的传奇成就，任何语言都苍白无力</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-01/6a95aee7a7aa1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">理所应当！记者：种种迹象都表明，阿根廷很快为梅西举办告别赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a58095b1938d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; marg